<title>UK: Dresdner leads bonds for three German hypo banks.</title>
<headline>Dresdner leads bonds for three German hypo banks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dresdner Bank AG said it was lead manager of structured bonds worth a total 500 million marks for three German hypotheken banks.</p>
<p>Deutsche Hypotheken Bank AG asked for 300 million marks, Norddeutsche Hypotheken- und Wechselbank AG for 100 million marks and Wuerttembergische Hypothekenbank AG also for 100 million marks.</p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE HYPOTHEKEN BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DEM   COUPON    *3.75	MATURITY   *14.FEB.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    23.SEP.96</p>
<p> NOTES     *PAR CALL ON 14.FEB.97 AFTER WHICH COUPON IS 4.85 PCT</p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p> BORROWER   NORDDEUTSCHE HYPOTHEKEN- UND WECHSELBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *3.75	MATURITY   *14.FEB.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    23.SEP.96</p>
<p> NOTES     *PAR CALL ON 14.FEB.97 AFTER WHICH COUPON IS 4.85 PCT</p>
<p>+ + +</p>
<p> BORROWER   WUERTTEMBERGISCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *3.75	MATURITY   *28.JAN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    24.SEP.96</p>
<p> NOTES     *PAR CALL ON 28.JAN.97 AFTER WHICH COUPON IS 4.85 PCT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
